, and safety/ship quality management to offer safe and optimized services that prioritize the customer."ABBA Voyage is a concert residency in London for which Wallenius Wilhelmsen is the official logistics partnerAffine Analytics Private Limited is a company located in Bangalore, KA, IN, providing analytics servicesAffine Analytics Private Limited is a company located at 453, BBMP No. 351/453, 4th sector, HSR Layout, Bangalore, KA, IN ‚Äì 560102. They offer sabbatical and long leave policies for their employees to manage competing priorities and take career breaks for specific reasons.Akihiro Fujimaru is the Managing Executive Officer of "K" LINE. He has emphasized the importance of fast, reliable, and global connectivity services for enhancing safety, quality, and the well-being of the crew, as well as supporting digitalization initiatives and automated ship navigation.The naming event for one of Maersk's green methanol ships held in Los AngelesAlfa Laval is a Swedish heavy industry company partnering with Wallenius to develop the Oceanbird concept's wingsail designAlice Johnson is the contact person and Procurement Manager for Tesla, Inc.Amazon is a major e-commerce company that relies on container shipping for its supply chain. It is also a significant shipper and a member of the Zero Emission Maritime Buyers Alliance. Additionally, Amazon is one of the 96 members of the FMC project.Ammonia is a future alternative fuel source that Wallenius Wilhelmsen's new vessels will be ready to use once it becomes availableAndean copper refers to the copper mined in the Andes region of South America, which is in high demand by ChinaA comprehensive report filed annually by a publicly traded company about its financial performanceAPEC is the Asia-Pacific Economic Cooperation forum where Xi Jinping and Joe Biden are expected to meetAquafina Bottled Water offers bulk purchase discounts, with discounts ranging from 4% to 12% based on the quantityArgentina is a country in South America that exports corn and soybeans to ChinaAustralia is a country that encompasses various regions and locations, including New South Wales and Bella Vista. It is also notable for hosting significant industrial operations, such as the ammonia cargo transfer operation in the Pilbara region. Additionally, Australia is currently experiencing port congestion, which is impacting vehicle exports.Baltimore is a city on the US east coast where a bridge collapse impacted Wallenius Wilhelmsen's operationsBangalore is a city in Karnataka, India, where Affine Analytics Private Limited is located.Beiersdorf AG is a company focused on expanding dermatology and skincare innovations through the use of artificial intelligence. The company is committed to investing in sustainable and cruelty-free formulations, while also strengthening its digital-first strategies to offer personalized skincare solutions. Additionally, Beiersdorf AG plays a crucial role as a supplier in a procurement agreement with Tesco, where it is responsible for delivering products and ensuring compliance with quality standards and regulations.Bella Vista is a location in New South Wales, Australia, known for being the base or address location for several major retail companies. It is where Carrefour, Lotte Mart, Tesco, and Woolworths Group have their addresses or are based.Bella Vista, New South Wales, is a significant location in Australia, serving as the address for several major retail companies. It is the site of Costco's address, as well as being mentioned in procurement agreements as the location for Tesco and Carrefour. Additionally, Bella Vista is noted as the address for the Woolworths Group in Australia. This highlights Bella Vista's importance as a hub for major retail operations in the region.Bella Vista, New South Wales, Australia is noted as the location for both Costco's and Tesco's addresses as mentioned in the procurement agreement.Ben & Jerry's is the supplier in the procurement agreement, located at 700 Anderson Hill Road, Purchase, New York, United StatesBen & Jerry‚Äôs is expanding vegan and dairy-free ice cream lines, strengthening ethical sourcing of ingredients, and enhancing e-commerce sales channels for direct-to-consumer deliveriesBen Palmer OBE is the President of Inmarsat Maritime. He has expressed honor in partnering with "K" LINE to trial NexusWave on its fleet, highlighting the strategic foresight of "K" LINE‚Äôs commitment to leveraging advanced technology for operational success and competitive edge.The Biden administration refers to the period when Joe Biden is President of the United States, during which the trade gap between China and the U.S. has widenedBiofuel is a sustainable fuel source that Wallenius Wilhelmsen is partnering with customers to use in order to reduce emissionsBrazil is a country in South America that is the largest exporter of soybeans to China. Additionally, Brazil is set to host the G20 summit.Busan is South Korea‚Äôs biggest port city where Hyundai Glovis plans to establish a logistics complexBYD Auto is China's largest NEV (New Energy Vehicle) manufacturer. It is involved in a strategic alliance with Hyundai Glovis for global shipping, collaborating on logistics and vehicle maritime transportation.California is a state in the United States where Tesla, Inc. is located. Additionally, it is the state where the laws governing the agreement are based.California, United States is the governing law jurisdiction for the procurement agreementCallao is a port on the Peruvian coast that, along with Chancay, will boost trade and the economy of Asia and the PacificCar-carrier vessels are ships used to transport thousands of vehicles at a time, which Hyundai Glovis uses for its shipping operations.The Caribbean is a region consisting of the Caribbean Sea, its islands, and the surrounding coasts, involved in trade with ChinaCarrefour, located at 1 Woolworths Way, Bella Vista, New South Wales, Australia, is the buyer in a procu