y recommendation systems to personalize shopping experiences for its customers. As part of its procurement strategy, Tesco is the buyer in agreements located at 1 Woolworths Way, Bella Vista, New South Wales, Australia. It is responsible for purchasing products from Beiersdorf AG and Nestle, conducting inspections to ensure quality compliance. These efforts reflect Tesco's commitment to innovation, quality, and customer satisfaction in its operations.Tesla, Inc. is the supplier in the procurement agreement, located at 3500 Deer Creek Road, Palo Alto, California, United States.The Clorox Company is actively expanding its range of eco-friendly and natural cleaning solutions, while also increasing its investment in AI-powered consumer engagement. Additionally, the company is strengthening its research and development efforts to create long-lasting disinfectant technologies. As part of its operations, The Clorox Company serves as the supplier in a procurement agreement and is located at 700 Anderson Hill Road, Purchase, New York, United States.The Coca-Cola Company is a prominent entity located at 700 Anderson Hill Road, Purchase, New York, United States. As a supplier in procurement agreements, the company is actively focusing on offering healthier beverage alternatives. In addition to enhancing its product offerings, The Coca-Cola Company is strengthening its investment in digital shopping experiences to better serve its customers. Furthermore, the company is committed to reducing its carbon footprint by implementing sustainable bottling practices, reflecting its dedication to environmental responsibility.Tide is a brand known for its liquid detergent with advanced stain-removal technologyTide Liquid Detergent offers bulk discounts, with discounts ranging from 5% to 13% based on the quantity purchasedTirranna is a car carrier prepared to receive the second prototype wing of the Oceanbird conceptTokyo is a city in Japan, where both MOL (Mitsui O.S.K. Lines) and K Line (Kawasaki Kisen Kaisha) are located.Tokyo, Japan is the location of the addresses for both K Line (Kawasaki Kisen Kaisha) and MOL (Mitsui O.S.K. Lines).Tropicana is a brand that produces 100% pure orange juice, rich in Vitamin C and packaged to retain freshnessTropicana Orange Juice provides bulk purchase discounts, with discounts ranging from 5% to 12% depending on the quantityThe Trump administration refers to the period when Donald Trump was President of the United States, during which China overtook the U.S. in trade in South and Central AmericaThe United Nations' Conference on Trade and Development provides analysis and policy recommendations on trade, investment, and development issues, including the cost of decarbonizing the shipping industryThe United Nations is an international organization mentioned in the context of setting goals for the shipping industry and providing estimates on decarbonization costsThe U.N.'s Conference on Trade and Development provides estimates on the cost of decarbonizing the shipping industryUncle Chips is a brand known for its classic potato chips, which are characterized by a crispy texture and are available in multiple flavors. The chips are packaged in air-sealed bags to ensure freshness. Additionally, Uncle Chips offers bulk discounts on its products, with discounts ranging from 5% to 12% depending on the quantity purchased.Unilever is a global company that is actively investing in eco-friendly product formulations, demonstrating its commitment to sustainability. The company is utilizing AI-based demand forecasting to enhance supply chain efficiency, ensuring that its operations are both effective and responsive to market needs. Additionally, Unilever is strengthening its presence in the personal care and beauty tech sectors, showcasing its innovation and adaptability in these dynamic industries. As part of its business operations, Unilever serves as the supplier in a procurement agreement, where it is responsible for delivering products to Woolworths Group, highlighting its role in facilitating product distribution and maintaining strong business partnerships.The United States is a country in North America that has been overtaken by China in trade with South and Central America and in presence in the Asia-Pacific region. It is the country where Tesla, Inc. is located, and it serves as the governing law jurisdiction for procurement agreements, specifically based in New York. Additionally, the United States is home to cities such as New York, Purchase, and Palo Alto, California.Uruguay is a country in South America that has begun trade talks with ChinaThe US Special Presidential Envoy for Climate, John Kerry, co-initiated the First Movers CoalitionVeson Nautical is a maritime software and services providerViasat is a global communications company that believes everyone and everything in the world can be connected. With offices in 24 countries, Viasat is developing a global communications network to provide high-quality, reliable, secure, affordable, and fast connections. In May 2023, Viasat completed its acquisition of Inmarsat, combining the teams, technologies, and resources of the two companies to create a new global communications partner.The ViaSat-3 class satellites are a series of satellites that are anticipated to provide significant benefits and are part of future satellite construction or acquisition plansThe ViaSat-3 Ka-band satellites are high-capacity satellites anticipated to launch, which will bolster the digitalization initiatives and connectivity services provided by NexusWave.Vincent Clerc is the CEO of MaerskVolcan is a Peruvian mining company that holds a 40% stake in the Chancay megaportVolkswagen Group is a German multinational automotive manufacturing company, having agreements with Hyundai GlovisThe Vice President (VP) at Affine Analytics is responsible for approving sabbatical and long leave requests. The VP is involved in the approval process for these types of leave requests, ensuring that all necessary approvals are obtained.Wallenius Marine is developing the Oceanbird concept for wind-powered cargo vesselsWallenius Wilhelmsen is a Norwegian shipping company dedicated to leading the industry towards a more sustainable future through actionable, science-based efforts to combat climate change. The company is involved in building methanol-capable and ammonia-ready vessels, and is launching next generation vessels to meet future fuel and emission standards. Wallenius Wilhelmsen has announced their intention to order a vessel of the Oceanbird concept and reported strong performance for Q1 2024.Wallenius Wilhelmsen Ocean is the buyer in the procurement agreement, located at 456 Maritime Way, Portsville, NJ 08001Walmart is a major retailer that relies on container shipping for its supply chain. As a significant player in the retail industry, Walmart is a major customer of CMA CGM, utilizing their services to ensure the efficient transportation of goods.White Bread offers bulk purchase discounts, with discounts ranging from 4% to 10% based on the quantityWilliam Clark is the contact person and Sales Director for Tesla, Inc. in the procurement agreementWoolworths Group, located at 1 Woolworths Way, Bella Vista, New South Wales, Australia, is actively engaged in several innovative and sustainable initiatives. The company is focusing on AI-driven supply chain optimization to enhance efficiency and effectiveness in its operations. Additionally, Woolworths Group is committed to sustainable packaging and green energy adoption, reflecting its dedication to environmental responsibility. The company is also exploring augmented reality (AR)-based in-store shopping experiences to improve customer engagement and satisfaction.

